    "hi_renewal_probability": "High end of the range for Renewal Probability, in percent like the base value. With Low, a property's Quality (1-5) positions the value: 3 = base, 5 = the favorable end (see Quality directions). Enter both or neither.",
    "hi_renewal_ti_per_sf": "High end of the range for Renewal TI $/SF, in dollars like the base value. With Low, a property's Quality (1-5) positions the value: 3 = base, 5 = the favorable end (see Quality directions). Enter both or neither.",
