    "increase_pct|Increase": "Size of each existing-customer rate increase, percent of that customer's current rent, e.g. 8.00.",
    "index_cap": "Floating loans only: strike of the borrower's purchased rate cap, percent, e.g. 5.00. The simulation limits the index at this level when setting the coupon. Blank = no cap.",
    "index_floor": "Floating loans only: minimum index rate, percent, e.g. 1.00. The note rate is the greater of the index and the floor, plus the spread. Blank = no floor.",
    "industry": "Tenant's business or industry, e.g. Legal or Grocery. Informational.",
    "intended_use": "Why the valuation is prepared, shown on reports. Free text.",
