    "io_period_months": "Months of interest-only payments at the start of the loan, e.g. 24. Amortizing payments begin afterward. 0 = amortizing from the start.",
    "is_gross_up_eligible": "Lets this expense be grossed up for recoveries when occupancy is below the gross-up target, so tenants are billed as if the building were at that occupancy. Use for costs that vary with occupancy, such as janitorial or utilities.",
    "is_pct_of_egi": "Tick to make this expense a percent of effective gross income each year instead of a dollar amount, typically the management fee (category management_fee).",
